speitado/Respeitada> pela Prole de Nozdormu para concluir a missão."},[8669]={d="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.$B$BBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="Leve os Braceletes do Domínio Qiraji, 2 Ídolos da Disputa, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para Andorgos em Ahn'Qiraj. Também é necessário ser <Tolerado/Tolerada> pela Prole de Nozdormu para concluir a missão."},[8687]={d="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora tunnelers.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="Mate 30 Escavadores da Colme'Zora e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate VII para concluir a missão."},[8689]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Marcial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos de Jaspe, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8690]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Régia Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Obsidianos, 5 Escaravelhos de Barro e 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8691]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Marcial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos de Alabastro, 5 Escaravelhos de Pedra e 5 Escaravelhos de Cristal para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8692]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Régia Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Vermelhos, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8693]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Marcial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Lazúli, 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze e 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8694]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Régia Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Âmbar, 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim e 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8695]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Régia Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Obsidianos, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8696]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Régia Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Bruxuleantes, 5 Escaravelhos de Pedra e 5 Escaravelhos de Cristal para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8697]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Cerimonial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Obsidianos, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8698]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Magistral Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Vermelhos, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8699]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Magistral Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Lazúli, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8700]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $g fellow : sister; druid.",o="Leve 1 Anel Magistral Qiraji, 2 Ídolos de Alabastro, 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze e 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8701]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Cerimonial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Ônix, 5 Escaravelhos de Pedra e 5 Escaravelhos de Cristal para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8702]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Cerimonial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos de Jaspe, 5 Escaravelhos de Pedra e 5 Escaravelhos de Cristal para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8703]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Magistral Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Vermelhos, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8704]={d="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.",o="Leve 1 Anel Cerimonial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Âmbar, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para a Arauto do Vento Yessendra em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Honrado/Honrada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8705]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho Ornamentado Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Bruxuleantes, 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze e 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8706]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho de Pontas Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Âmbar, 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim e 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8707]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho Ornamentado Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Obsidianos, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8708]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho Ornamentado Qiraji, 2 Ídolos de Jaspe, 5 Escaravelhos de Cristal e 5 Escaravelhos de Pedra para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8709]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho de Pontas Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Rubros, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8710]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho Ornamentado Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Ônix, 5 Escaravelhos de Ouro e 5 Escaravelhos de Barro para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8711]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho de Pontas Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Âmbar, 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze e 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8712]={d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="Leve 1 Punho de Pontas Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Lazúli, 5 Escaravelhos de Prata e 5 Escaravelhos de Osso para o Guardião Haro em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Exaltado/Exaltada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."},[8728]={d="Well that took a little longer than expected. Now let me see what this ledger says.$B$B<Narain silently reads the ledger, periodically mumbling under his breath.>$B$B The good news is that I am 99% certain that I am capable of creating an arcanite buoy that will function to your specifications. This is, of course, wholly dependant on the bad news.$B$BThe bad news is that I'm going to need a lot of arcanite, elementium ore, and rare gemstones.$B$BBring me what I need and I will craft the buoy.",o="Narain Suavestilo, em Tanaris, quer que você leve para ele 20 Barras de Arcanita, 10 Minérios de Elemêntio, 10 Diamantes Azerotianos e 10 Safiras Azuis."},[8729]={d="Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit.$B$BAccording to my superior psycho-psionic clairvoyance, you'll find that the best spot to cast this buoy is off the coast of Azshara, in the Bay of Storms.$B$BLook for a swirling maelstrom, most likely cluttered with wreckage.$B$BBy the by, I hope you have friends.$B$BNow if you somehow miraculously succeed, take the scepter shard to Anachronos.",o="Use a Boia de Arcanita na Voragem Serpenteante da Baía das Tempestades, que fica em Azshara."},[8730]={d="Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it... But what would tragedy be without cruelty?$B$B<Vaelastrasz coughs weakly.>$B$BNe... Nefarius now holds the scepter shard.$B$BTime is of the essence. Nefarius plans to destroy the shard. You must hurry!",o="Mate Nefarian e recupere o Estilhaço de Cetro Vermelho. Devolva o Estilhaço de Cetro Vermelho a Anacronos nas Cavernas do Tempo, em Tanaris. Você tem 5 horas para concluir a tarefa."},[8731]={d="Greetings, $N.  Before I assign you to more involved tasks in the war, you'll need to do your share of field duty.  $B$BYou will find Captain Skullsplit's Orgrimmar Legion outside Hive'Regal.$B$BReport to him and come back to me with proof of your field service.  I shall have a more advanced assignment ready for you.$B$BOh, please do your best to stay away from the Ironforge Brigade.  Tensions are high among our Alliance and Horde volunteers.",o="Apresente-se para Krug Rachacrânio no posto da Legião de Orgrimmar em frente a Colme'Régia. Prepare seus Papéis em Branco de Serviço em Campanha, obtenha Papéis Assinados de Serviço em Campanha e leve-os ao Arauto do Vento Kaldon no Forte Cenariano. Nota: curar ou lançar feitiços benéficos em um membro da Legião de Orgrimmar marcará você para o JxJ."},[8733]={d="This is a journey of redemption, hero. Would it be that I was slain today, I would have died for a just and righteous cause. You must recover the green scepter shard. You must cleanse Eranikus of the taint placed upon him by the Old Gods.$B$BTravel to Darnassus. Just outside the city walls you will find one of my agents. This agent will set things in motion for us and inform Tyrande of our plans without alerting Staghelm.$B$B<Malfurion sighs.>$B$BA fall from grace a thousand years in the making...",o="Vá para o continente de Teldrassil e encontre o agente de Malfurion perto das muralhas de Darnassus."},[8734]={d="Tyrande will be notifed, mortal. Shan'do Stormrage has prepared me for this contingency.$B$BNow you must venture to the Moonglade and speak with Remulos. He will have further instruction as to the summoning of Eranikus.$B$BWe all wish you great luck.",o="Vá à Clareira da Lua e fale com o Guardião Remulos."},[8735]={d="You must travel to the four dream portals of Azeroth. From each you must draw a fragment of the Nightmare's corruption. The dragonkin that inhabit these areas will hold such fragments. Return to me when you have gathered these fragments.",o="Vá até os quatro portais do Sonho Esmeralda em Azeroth e obtenha um Fragmento da Corrupção do Pesadelo de cada um. Quando tiver cumprido essa tarefa, fale novamente com o Guardião Remulos na Clareira da Lua."},[8736]={d="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him.$B$BTyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction.$B$BBe on guard! You and your allies are our only hope.",o="Defenda o Refúgio Noturno de Erânicos. Impeça que o Guardião Remulos pereça. Não mate Erânicos. Defenda-se. Espere Tyrande."},[8737]={d="The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus.  With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.$B$BFind a way to summon and destroy an Azure Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.",o="Summon and slay an Azure Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest."},[8738]={d="We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence.  Scout Landion has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Regal for several days now.  Find him and obtain a written report.  We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, $N.",o="Contate o Batedor Cenariano Landion no interior da Colme'Régia e entregue o Relatório do Batedor de Colme'Régia ao Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo no Forte Cenariano. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções Táticas VII para concluir a missão."},[8739]={d="We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence.  Scout Jalia has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Ashi for several days now.  Find her and obtain a written report.  We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, $N.",o="Contate a Batedora Cenariana Jalia no interior da Colme'Ashi e entregue o Relatório do Batedor de Colme'Ashi ao Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo no Forte Cenariano. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções Táticas VIII para concluir a missão."},[8740]={d="Bands of mounted Twilight's Hammer cultists have been spotted riding outside the reach of our forces in Cenarion Hold, picking off our smaller patrols and caravans.$B$BFind and defeat the twilight marauders along with their leader, a terrible warrior by the name of Morna.  Report to Windcaller Proudhorn after completing the task.",o="Mate a Espoliadora do Crepúsculo Mirna e 5 Espoliadores do Crepúsculo. Apresente-se ao Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo depois que tiver concluído a tarefa. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções Táticas IX para concluir a missão."},[8741]={d="The keeper awaits your return, $N. Take the green scepter shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",o="Take the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris."},[8746]={d="DISASTER has struck!  Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!$B$BMetzen is one of Great-father Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures.  We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen.  With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here!  Please - find Metzen and return him to us!$B$BCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!$B$BPlease, hurry!",o="Encontre Metzen, a Rena. Procure por pistas nos pedidos de resgate para descobrir onde ele está sendo mantido. Quando encontrar Metzen, use a Bolsa de Pó de Rena para jogar um pozinho nele. Isso irá livrar Metzen do cativeiro. Após libertar Metzen, devolva a Bolsa de Pó de Rena para Polyxopo Pechisbeque em Orgrimmar."},[8762]={d="DISASTER has struck!  Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!$B$BMetzen is one of Greatfather Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures.  We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen.  With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here!  Please - find Metzen and return him to us!$B$BCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!$B$BPlease, hurry!",o="Encontre Metzen, a Rena. Procure por pistas nos pedidos de resgate para descobrir onde ele está sendo mantido. Quando encontrar Metzen, use a Bolsa de Pó de Rena para jogar um pozinho nele. Isso livrará Metzen do cativeiro. Após libertar Metzen, devolva a Bolsa de Pó de Rena para Wulmort \"Dindim\" Goubel em Altaforja."},[8763]={d="Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.",o="Deposite 1 punhado de Sal Rochafunda e 5 moedas de ouro em qualquer Secadora de Azevinho para receber 5 Azevinhos Secos."},[8770]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi defenders.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Defenders and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest."},[8771]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi sandstalkers.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Mate 30 Espreitareias da Colme'Ashi e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate II para concluir a missão."},[8772]={d="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora waywatchers.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="Mate 30 Atalaias da Colme'Zora e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate VI para concluir a missão."},[8773]={d="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora reavers.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="Mate 30 Aniquiladores da Colme'Zora e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate IV para concluir a missão."},[8774]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the Hive'Regal ambushers.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Mate 30 Emboscadores da Colme'Régia e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate VIII para concluir a missão."},[8775]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the airborne Hive'Regal spitfires.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Mate 30 Cospe-fogos da Colme'Régia e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate IX para concluir a missão."},[8776]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the Hive'Regal slavemakers.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Mate 30 Escravizadores da Colme'Régia e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate X para concluir a missão."},[8777]={d="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of Hive'Regal burrowers.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="Mate 30 Entocadores da Colme'Régia e fale novamente com o Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Combate XI para concluir a missão."},[8778]={d="The Ironforge Brigade has put in an unusual request for highly... volatile... components.  Gather them and bring them to Mr. Nozzlespring from the Ironforge Brigade.",o="Leve 6 Óleos de Imolação, 5 Combustíveis de Foguete Goblínico e 10 Pós Explosivos Densos para a Arcanista Molabico, que está perto de Colme'Zora, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística IV para completar esta tarefa."},[8779]={d="Geologist Larksbane's studies have proven to be of tremendous value to our operations in Silithus.  She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.$B$BPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research.",o="Leve 1 Estilhaço Brilhante Grande, 1 Estilhaço Radiante Grande e 1 Esmeralda Enorme para a Geóloga Matarriso, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística V para concluir esta missão."},[8780]={d="The Ironforge Brigade's supply of armor kits in the battlefield is running dangerously low.  Obtain a batch and deliver them to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade's outpost outside Hive'Zora.",o="Leve 8 Kits de Armadura Rústica e 8 Kits de Armadura Pesada para Jenila Fortemalho no Posto Avançado da Brigada de Altaforja, perto da Colme'Zora, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VII para concluir a missão."},[8781]={d="The Ironforge Brigade has been a worthy ally in our fight in Silithus.  Unfortunately, many of their supplies were lost on their way here.  Procure a batch of weapons and deliver them to Janela Stouthammer near Hive'Zora.",o="Leve 2 Espadas Largas de Lunaço para Jenila Fortemalho no Posto Avançado da Brigada de Altaforja, perto da Colme'Zora. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VI para concluir a missão."},[8782]={d="The latest influx of volunteers has caused a shortage of uniforms.  Procure a batch of uniform materials and bring them to Windcaller Proudhorn.",o="Leve 1 Lunatrama, 2 Peças de Runatrama e 1 Seda de Aranha Ferroteia para o Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VIII para concluir esta missão."},[8783]={d="Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces.  Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped.",o="Leve 2 Barras de Tório Encantado e 2 Couros Encantados para Vargus, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística IX para concluir a missão."},[8784]={d="You have discovered an ancient Qiraji artifact! Perhaps one of the dragons near the entrance of the temple would have a use for this relic.",o="Leve o Artefato Qiraji Antigo aos dragões escondidos perto da entrada do templo."},[8785]={d="The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for several unusual ingredients.  Given their current performance in Silithus, we'd like to comply with their request as soon as possible.  Gather the materials and bring them to the troll called Shai.",o="Leve 6 Mojos Poderosos, 6 Frascos de Mojo Grande e 8 Óleos de Imolação para a Sacerdotisa Sombria Shai, que fica perto de Colme'Régia, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística IV para completar esta tarefa."},[8786]={d="The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for additional weapons that we haven't been able to provide at the moment.  Obtain the weapons they've requested and bring them to Merok Longstride outside of Hive'Regal.",o="Leve 3 Machados Sólidos de Ferro para Merok Passo Longo no acampamento da Legião de Orgrimmar, do lado de fora da Colme'Régia. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VI para concluir a missão."},[8787]={d="The brave volunteers of the Orgrimmar Legion have arrived to Silithus to aid us in our cause.  Their supplies of armor kits were somehow lost in the trip.  Obtain a batch of armor kits and deliver them to Merok Longstride at the location of the Orgrimmar Legion camp.",o="Leve 8 Kits de Armadura Rústica e 8 Kits de Armadura Pesada para Merok Passo Longo perto de Colme'Régia. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VII para concluir a missão."},[8789]={d="We have not sat idly by for a millennium, $N.$B$BWe have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world. And we have learned of their own internal treachery.$B$BWeaknesses exist and we know how to use those weaknesses to our advantage.$B$BFind and bring me their ceremonial armaments: Combined with the element created from the volatility of their own God, they will become a force of reckoning.",o="Arygos, no Templo de Ahn'Qiraj, criará Armamentos Infundidos em Elemêntio para você. Para tanto, entregue-lhe Armamentos Imperiais Qirajis e 3 Minérios de Elemêntio."},[8790]={d="Arygos theorizes that the element which is born of conflicts between the Old Gods and their minions is also extremely deadly to them under the right conditions. I speak of Elementium, mortal.$B$BFind and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power.",o="Merithra do Sonho, no Templo de Ahn'Qiraj, criará Armamentos Infundidos em Elemêntio para você. Para tanto, entregue-lhe Paramentos Imperiais Qiraji e 3 Minérios de Elemêntio."},[8791]={d="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.$B$BThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.",o="Entregue a Cabeça de Ossirian, o Imaculado, ao Comandante Mar'alith no Forte Cenariano, que fica em Silithus."},[8792]={d="Olá, que bom que você resolveu me dar ouvidos. A Horda precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de você! Enquanto tagarelamos, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem sua ajuda, $N!$B$BFale com o encarregado, o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk. Então, $c? Podemos contar com sua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk no Vale dos Espíritos em Orgrimmar."},[8793]={d="Olá, que bom que você resolveu me dar ouvidos. A Horda precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de você! Enquanto tagarelamos, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem sua ajuda, $N!$B$BFale com o encarregado, o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk. Então, $c? Podemos contar com sua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk no Vale dos Espíritos em Orgrimmar."},[8794]={d="Olá, que bom que você resolveu me dar ouvidos. A Horda precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de você! Enquanto tagarelamos, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem sua ajuda, $N!$B$BFale com o encarregado, o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk. Então, $c? Podemos contar com sua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Senhor da Guerra Gorchuk no Vale dos Espíritos em Orgrimmar."},[8795]={d="Olá, que bom que tu resolveste me escutar. A Aliança precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de ti! Enquanto mantemos este colóquio, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem tua ajuda, $N!$B$BFala com o encarregado, o Marechal-de-campo Nevado. Como é, $c? Podemos contar com tua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Marechal-de-campo Nevado na Ala Militar de Altaforja."},[8796]={d="Olá, que bom que tu resolveste me escutar. A Aliança precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de ti! Enquanto mantemos este colóquio, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem tua ajuda, $N!$B$BFala com o encarregado, o Marechal-de-campo Nevado. Como é, $c? Podemos contar com tua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Marechal-de-campo Nevado na Ala Militar de Altaforja."},[8797]={d="Olá, que bom que tu resolveste me escutar. A Aliança precisa de toda a ajuda que conseguir para os preparativos de guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Ou seja, precisamos de ti! Enquanto mantemos este colóquio, os coletores oficiais reúnem o material necessário à guerra iminente, mas não seremos capazes de cumprir as metas sem tua ajuda, $N!$B$BFala com o encarregado, o Marechal-de-campo Nevado. Como é, $c? Podemos contar com tua ajuda em preparativos tão vitais?",o="Fale com o Marechal-de-campo Nevado na Ala Militar de Altaforja."},[8799]={d="Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.",o="Deposite 1 punhado de Sal Rochafunda e 5 moedas de ouro em qualquer Secadora de Azevinho para receber 5 Azevinhos Secos."},[8800]={d="As you complete the tasks you're assigned in the war you'll want to talk to Vargus, the blacksmith.  Show him any badges you've earned along the way. He'll provide you with gear to match your level of commitment to our cause.",o="Apresente-se a Vargus no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus."},[8801]={d="The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.$B$BAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.$B$BYou have done what was thought to be impossible.$B$BYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.$B$BTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber. ",o="Leve o Olho de C'Thun para Celestrasz no Templo de Ahn'Qiraj."},[8802]={d="To the Caverns of Time you go, $G Lord:Lady; $N. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="Leve o Olho de C'Thun para Anacronos nas Cavernas do Tempo."},[8804]={d="With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.",o="Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest."},[8805]={d="The mounted division of the Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of ornate mithril boots.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="Leve 3 Botas Ornadas de Mithril para Vish Kozus, Capitão da Guarda, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística II para concluir a missão."},[8806]={d="The Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of grinding stones.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="Leve 10 Pedras de Amolar Densas, 10 Pedras de Amolar Maciças e 10 Pedras de Amolar Pesadas para Vish Kozus, Capitão da Guarda, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística III para concluir a missão."},[8807]={d="Geologist Larksbane's studies have proven to be of tremendous value to our operations in Silithus.  She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.$B$BPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research.",o="Leve 1 Estilhaço Brilhante Grande, 1 Estilhaço Radiante Grande e 1 Esmeralda Enorme para a Geóloga Matarriso, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística V para concluir esta missão."},[8808]={d="The latest influx of volunteers has caused a shortage of uniforms.  Procure a batch of uniform materials and bring them to Windcaller Proudhorn.",o="Leve 1 Lunatrama, 2 Peças de Runatrama e 1 Seda de Aranha Ferroteia para o Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística VIII para cumprir esta missão."},[8809]={d="Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces.  Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped.",o="Leve 2 Barras de Tório Encantado e 2 Couros Encantados para Vargus, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística IX para concluir a missão."},[8810]={d="Our supply of bandages in the battlefield is running dangerously low after the recent casualties we have incurred.  Obtain a batch of first-aid supplies and deliver them to Windcaller Proudhorn in Cenarion Hold.",o="Leve 30 Bandagens Grossas de Runatrama, 30 Bandagens Grossas de Seda e 30 Bandagens Grossas de Magitrama para o Arauto do Vento Chifre Altivo, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística X para concluir esta missão."},[8827]={d="I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them.",o="Fale com o Papai Inverno. Ele está perto dos vendedores da Fazenda Bosque Defumado, em Altaforja."},[8828]={d="Ouvi dizer que o Papai Inverno, com a ajuda da Fazenda Bosque Defumado, colocou presentes para a galera lá debaixo da árvore, em Orgrimmar. Eu queria dar um pulo lá, mas tenho que tomar conta do Voltímato de Inverno PX-238.$b$bMas não deixa de passar lá, não. Garanto que o Papai Inverno tem presentes para você também!",o="Fale com o Papai Inverno. Ele está perto dos vendedores da Fazenda Bosque Defumado, em Orgrimmar."},[8829]={d="The Twilight's Hammer operates through innumerable layers of secrecy and deceit.  While their actions are carried out in our world, they are planned in a place we have not yet been able to reach.$B$BWe've come to believe that the stones the Twilight's Hammer uses to summon their superiors allow for two-way transportation.  To attempt to use them in this manner, we must replicate - to every last detail - a twilight emissary's robe.$B$BGather the necessary materials and bring them to Aurel Goldleaf, $N.  ",o="Leve uma Pele de Sombra, 3 Suturas de Abominação Puídas e 1 Veste de Sectário do Crepúsculo para Aurel Folháurea, no Forte Cenariano, em Silithus. Você também precisa entregar as Instruções de Logística XI para concluir a missão."},[8856]={d="With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.",o="Leve 4 Globos de Água, 4 Antipeçonhas Poderosos e 4 Salmões Assados para Calandrath na estalagem do Forte Cenariano, em Silithus."},[8857]={d="I'm looking for battle hardened adventurers willing and able to get a fresh husk sample from the fallen Colossus of Ashi to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. No, no, I wouldn't want you to go anywhere near that thing's corpse. Just take one of my samples and make it snappy. These things are no good to him rotten!",o="Leve a Carapaça do Colosso de Ashi a Olhatorto Obnótico na Angra do Butim."},[8858]={d="There ain't nothin' I'd like more than to stuff this bug husk down Oilfist's fat face... Cept, I'm stuck here collectin' samples from that overgrown cockroach. I'll be here 'till the wee mornin' hours given the size o' that thing.$B$BTake this here sample to Oilfist fer me and do it fast, $c. He's payin' BIG!$B$BYar, Thorium Point - it be in the Searin' Gorge.",o="Leve a Carapaça do Colosso de Régia ao Feitor Mão-de-graxa na Garganta Abrasadora."},[8859]={d="My servants were nearly killed in their efforts to recover this sample. You absolutely must hurry! Lord Maxwell Tyrosus eagerly awaits a fresh husk sample. He believes that the secrets of this Colossus could help us in the war against the Scourge!$B$BWhy are you still here!? To Light's Hope! Yes, you will be rewarded handsomely for your efforts...",o="Leve a Carapaça do Colosso de Zora ao Lorde Maximiliano Tyrosus na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais."},[8860]={d="Stormwind is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day long today you can get free booze, and at night they'll put on a firework show!  It should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Allison is in the Gilded Rose, in the Trade District of Stormwind.",o="Entregue o Suprimento do Bosque Defumado para a Estalajadeira Cristine em Ventobravo."},[8861]={d="O Penhasco do Trovão está dando uma festa de fim de ano! Você vai poder beber de graça o dia inteiro, e à noite vai rolar um show de fogos de artifício! Vai ser uma beleza... O lance é que também vai ter festa lá na Angra do Butim, e eu aposto que vai ser muito melhor!$B$BMas vamos ao que interessa: a estalajadeira Pala, lá no Penhasco do Trovão, mandou um pedido de delícias do Bosque Defumado para a festa. Você poderia me fazer o favor de entregar a encomenda?$B$BObrigado, $N! A estalajadeira Pala está lá na estalagem perto da ponte que leva ao Platô dos Caçadores.",o="Entregue o Suprimento do Bosque Defumado para a Estalajadeira Pala no Penhasco do Trovão."},[8867]={d="Todos os anos, os druidas da Clareira da Lua comemoram a grande vitória da nossa cidade contra um mal ancestral.$B$BNós celebramos a sabedoria dos nossos anciãos, damos maravilhosos banquetes e, é claro... Soltamos fogos de artifício!$B$BNossos mercadores negociam foguetes das mais diversas cores em troca de uma pequena quantia simbólica. Tente usá-los em algum dos lançadores espalhados pela clareira, $N.",o="Lance 8 Fogos de Artifício da Lua, 2 Salvas de Fogos de Artifício e fale novamente com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua em qualquer cidade capital."},[8868]={d="The beast Omen was once a hero of this world.  A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics.  Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.$B$BFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara.  But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...$B$BGather cohorts, $N, and summon and defeat the beast Omen.  Earn the blessing of Elune!",o="Evoque Agouro, derrote-o e ganhe a Bênção de Eluna. Fale com Valadar Stelacanto no Refúgio Noturno."},[8869]={d="Within the confines of the Scarlet Bastion lies sweet Serenity. The Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe with his life. Defeat him and bring me his apron. For that, I shall train you to become a hammersmith.$B$BUnderstand this: Once you have chosen the path of the hammersmith, the paths of the swordsmith and axesmith will no longer be available.",o="Vá para Stratholme e mate o Forjador de Martelos Carmesim. Recolha o Avental do Forjador de Martelos Carmesim e leve-o para Lilith."},[8870]={d="It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua na Ala Mística de Altaforja. Você também pode falar com Anfitriãs do Festival da Lua em outras capitais."},[8871]={d="It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua no Distrito do Parque de Ventobravo. Você também pode falar com outros Anfitriões do Festival da Lua em outras capitais."},[8872]={d="It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua no Enclave Cenariano, em Darnassus. Há, nas outras capitais, outras Anfitriãs do Festival da Lua com quem se pode falar."},[8873]={d="Chegou a época que tanto esperávamos, $N! O Círculo Cenariano convida todos os habitantes de Azeroth a participar do Festival da Lua. A Anfitriã do Festival da Lua está nesta cidade em um lugar indicado por um círculo sagrado de luz lunar. Ela poderá lhe falar mais sobre o festival.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua no Vale da Sabedoria em Orgrimmar. Você também pode falar com Anfitriãs do Festival da Lua em outras capitais."},[8874]={d="Espero por essa data todos os anos, $N! O Círculo Cenariano convida todos os habitantes de Azeroth a tomar parte na celebração do Festival da Lua A Anfitriã do Festival da Lua pode ser encontrada nesta cidade, no local marcado por um círculo sacro de luz do luar. Mais informações sobre o festival podem ser obtidas com ela.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua na entrada da Cidade Baixa. Você também pode falar com outros Anfitriões do Festival da Lua em outras capitais."},[8875]={d="Espero por essa data todos os anos, $N! O Círculo Cenariano convida todos os habitantes de Azeroth a tomar parte na celebração do Festival da Lua A Anfitriã do Festival da Lua pode ser encontrada nesta cidade, no local marcado por um círculo sacro de luz do luar. Mais informações sobre o festival podem ser obtidas com ela.",o="Fale com a Anfitriã do Festival da Lua no Platô dos Anciãos, que fica no Penhasco do Trovão. Você também pode falar com outros Anfitriões do Festival da Lua em outras capitais."},[8883]={d="Now that you have your Lunar Festival invitation, you may travel to Moonglade!  There you will find many revelers, and in the village of Nighthaven Valadar Starsong and his sister Fariel await those eager to participate in the celebration.$B$BTravel to Moonglade through the greater moonlight and speak with Valadar Starsong; see what prizes you might gain during the festival!",o="Use o Convite do Festival da Lua na luz da lua para ir à Clareira da Lua. Ao chegar, fale com Valadar Stelacanto no Refúgio Noturno."},[8897]={d="I've got to keep watch here at the gate, but I'm always worrying about my sweetheart, Colara. I only get to see her for a few hours, if I'm lucky, and well, just look at me. I've got a minor officer's pay and I could be called to the front any day now.$b$bWould she just forget about me? There are a lot of men in the city. A lot of rich ones.$b$bAnyways, I've scribbled some things down... nothing much, but if you could take it to her for me, that'd be great.",o="Entregue o Bilhete Cuidadosamente Escrito do Tenente Heldric para Colara Dean em frente ao banco de Ventobravo."},[8898]={d="I met a lass in Stormwind when I was last there on the bank's business. She stole my heart away. Now, I can't stop thinking about her! I'd like to send her this message - I've rewritten it twelve times!$b$bThe mail is so full now, and I want to make sure it gets there.$b$bIf you're heading that way, could you help me?",o="Entregue a Carta Vincada para Colara Dean em frente ao banco de Ventobravo."},[8899]={d="How to describe her beauty? Thousands of years of words and I am at a loss.$b$bThese mortals confound the mind and leave us babbling fools.$b$bI've stared at these words too long. No more eloquent meaning can I squeeze from them. No, she must have it now, or some other suitor will surely steal her eye.",o="Entregue a Carta Imaculada para Colara Dean, que está em frente ao banco de Ventobravo."},[8900]={d="Ela estava tão triste! Dava para perceber, ela não era assim.$b$bMas depois que conversamos, houve uma conexão entre nós. Eu não acreditava que alguém pudesse entender o que eu estava sentindo, mas ela pôde.$b$bQuando contei aos outros, eles riram de mim. Então eu nunca mais falei com ela. Mas sinto muita saudade. Você poderia entregar esta carta para ela? Quero ter certeza de que a carta chegará às mãos da minha amada.",o="Entregue o Bilhete Levemente Vincado para Helena Raiol perto do banco da Cidade Baixa."},[8901]={d="Você já se apaixonou, $Gmeu jovem:minha jovem;? Eu não sabia o que era amor até pouco tempo atrás, quando conheci uma garota da Cidade Baixa, a Helena. É muito raro alguém do meu povo se interessar por estrangeiros, ainda mais uma Renegada!$b$bMas agora eu só faço pensar nela dia e noite.$b$bVocê poderia entregar esta carta para a minha Helena? Quero que ela venha para Mulgore. Espero que ela diga sim.",o="Entregue a Carta Cuidadosamente Escrita para Helena Raiol perto do banco na Cidade Baixa."},[8902]={d="Há muito tempo, fui noivo de Helena, a paixão da minha infância. Eu fiquei anos sem pensar nela mas, ultimamente, não consigo tirá-la da cabeça.$b$bQuem sabe, mesmo depois de todo esse tempo, ainda possa haver espaço em nossas vidas para o nosso amor?$b$bTenho certeza que Helena também está diferente. Você poderia entregar essa carta para ela? Estou muito nervoso para entregar em pessoa.",o="Entregue a Carta Escrita com Amor para Helena Raiol, que está perto do banco da Cidade Baixa."},[8903]={d="There's something unnatural about this epidemic of love. It's not proper, it's an eyesore, and at worst, it could be a threat to the the safety of the Alliance itself.$b$bJust think: what if the guards have been taken in by this strange affliction? Something must be done.$b$bGo to one of the guards here in Stormwind and see if they've been caught up in this foolishness.",o="Pegue um Cartão do Guarda de Ventobravo e entregue-o para Aristeu Motta em Ventobravo."},[8904]={d="Tem algo estranho nessa epidemia de amor. A situação é muito desagradável e, pior ainda, reduz nossas defesas, o que pode ser uma ameaça a todos nós.$b$bNão bastasse todo mundo estar fazendo esse papel ridículo, acho que até mesmo os nossos guardiões foram afetados. Justamente eles, que deveriam ser imunes a essas coisas.$b$bProcure um dos nossos guardiões e verifique se a tropa foi realmente afetada por essa tolice.",o="Pegue um Cartão Mofado do Guardião e entregue-o para Félix Amado na Cidade Baixa."},[8905]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Consiga 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras do Coração Selvagem e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8906]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Consiga 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braceletes do Espreitador de Feras e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8907]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braceletes do Magíster e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8908]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras da Forja de Luz e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8909]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, 1 par de Braçadeiras do Devoto e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8910]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Consiga 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras da Arte Sombria e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8911]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Consiga 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras de Brumedo e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8912]={d="Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Sangue de Hibérnia, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras do Valor e leve para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8913]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras do Coração Selvagem e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8914]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braceletes do Espreitador de Feras e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8915]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braceletes do Magíster e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8916]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras do Devoto e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8917]={d="Salve, $c! Pelo seu semblante, dá para perceber que você já passou por muita coisa neste mundo. Mas posso apostar que você não viu uma armadura deste tipo.$B$BSe me fizer um favorzinho, posso trocar seu par de braçadeiras comuns por esta belezura.$B$BPreciso de uma boa quantidade de veneno das aranhas e escorpiões de Silithus. Se me trouxer isso junto com algumas moedas de ouro, podemos fazer essa troca.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras da Arte Sombria e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8918]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braceletes dos Elementos e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8919]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras de Brumedo e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8920]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="Adquira 15 Amostras de Peçonha de Silithus, 20 peças de ouro, um par de Braçadeiras do Valor e leve para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8921]={d="Ah, you're in need of my latest project... the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!  Unfortunately I've run out of funds and manpower.$B$BYou're willing to help?  Excellent!  Our first task is to build a device to harvest the very fabric of death!  Building an ectoplasmic distiller won't be an easy task, $N.$B$BI'll need you to bring me an arcanite converter, some greater eternal essences and stonescale oil. I'll also need some volcanic ash from the lava pools in the Burning Steppes to build a filter.",o="Leve para o Mux Zoamana, em Geringontzan, 1 Conversor Delicado de Arcanita, 4 Essências Eternas Maiores, 10 unidades de Óleo de Petrescama, 25 Cinzas Vulcânicas e 40 peças de ouro."},[8922]={d="I must find a way to speak with Anthion Harmon... or more specifically, his ghost!$B$BI know of an engineer with a queer interest in the supernatural.  He claims he can build a machine that allows him to speak with the dead!$B$BThe blood you collected was intended for him; travel to Gadgetzan and bring it to him as payment for his services! ",o="Leve o Recipiente Lacrado de Sangue para Mux Zoamana em Geringontzan, em Tanaris."},[8923]={d="You must be quite brave to have stuck around after that.  That or I've piqued your interest with the piece of armor I gave you.  There is more from where that came from, if you're still interested in aiding me.$B$BThe venom samples you collected are for an acquaintance of mine, Mux Manascrambler, an engineer with an interest in the supernatural.  His latest project consists of a device that allows you to communicate with the dead!  My last hope is to contact Anthion and find out more about my situation.",o="Leve o Recipiente de Peçonha Lacrado para Mux Zoamana em Geringontzan."},[8924]={d="A fine piece of engineering, if I do say so myself!  You will need to travel a bit, I'm afraid, in order to find the incorporeal undead we require.$B$BYou see, different climates lend different consistencies to the spectral fabric of the dead.  The tortured night elves of Silithus, the spirits of the highborne from Winterspring and the ghosts and banshees of the Eastern Plaguelands should give us the different types of ectoplasm we need.  Be sure to place the distiller nearby before you harvest them!",o="Use o Destilador Ectoplásmico perto de mortos-vivos incorpóreos para coletar 12 Ectoplasmas Chamuscados em Silithus, 12 Ectoplasmas Congelados em Hibérnia e 12 Ectoplasmas Estáveis nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais. Leve-os juntamente com o Destilador Ectoplásmico para Mux Zoamana em Geringontzan."},[8925]={d="Next we shall need to find a stable and portable source of energy to keep the ectoplasm active.  I've heard rumors of a mighty elemental called Magma Lord Bokk, whose heart is a powerful magma core - an endless supply of heat!$B$BIt's said he can be found in the Burning Steppes, south of Blackrock Mountain.  Bring the magma core to me and we shall have enough juice to power the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!",o="Encontre Bokk, Senhor do Magma, nas Estepes Ardentes, obtenha o Núcleo de Magma dele e leve-o para Mux Zoamana em Geringontzan."},[8926]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto do Coração Selvagem e um par de Luvas do Coração Selvagem para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8927]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto do Coração Selvagem e um par de Luvas do Coração Selvagem para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8928]={d="The core will provide us with enough juice to power our device; now we just have to build a rod that can channel that energy without melting.$B$BI met an imp in Winterspring that sold all manner of exotic goods.  He had an elemental rod that would do perfectly.  I'm kicking myself in the head right now for not having bought it.$B$BHe lives inside a cave in the entrance to Darkwhisper Gorge.  Sneak in there and try to find him.$B$BMake sure he only charges you forty gold; that's the price he quoted me!",o="Procure um diabrete em uma caverna na entrada da Garganta do Sussurro Sombrio, no sul de Hibérnia, compre um Bastão de Elemental Vil e fale novamente com Mux Zoamana em Geringontzan."},[8929]={d="Well, nothing left for us to do but try out the goblin's invention.  Word has it that Anthion was mowed down by the undead legions of Stratholme as he tried to enter its gates.$B$BTry using the device there and find out whatever Anthion knew.",o="Use o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas na entrada de Stratholme e fale com o fantasma de Anthion Harmon."},[8930]={d="Very well, $N.  All that remains is to put the goblin's invention to the test.  Word has it that Anthion was slain by the undead legions of Stratholme as he tried to enter its gates.$B$BTry using the device there and see if, indeed, you can speak with the dead!",o="Use o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas na entrada de Stratholme e fale com o fantasma de Anthion Harmon."},[8931]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.",o="Leve um Cinto do Espreitador de Feras e um par de Luvas do Espreitador de Feras para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8932]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.",o="Leve um Cinto do Magíster e um par de Luvas do Magíster para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8933]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto da Forja de Luz e um par de Manoplas da Forja de Luz para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8934]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto do Devoto e um par de Luvas do Devoto para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8935]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto da Arte Sombria e um par de Luvas da Arte Sombria para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8936]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto de Brumedo e um par de Guarda-braços de Brumedo para Deliana em Altaforja."},[8937]={d="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="Leve um Cinto do Valor e um par de Manoplas do Valor para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8938]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto do Espreitador de Feras e um par de Luvas do Espreitador de Feras para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8939]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto do Magíster e um par de Luvas do Magíster para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8940]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto do Devoto e um par de Luvas do Devoto para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8941]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto da Arte Sombria e um par de Luvas da Arte Sombria para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8942]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cordão dos Elementos e um par de Manoplas dos Elementos para Mokvar em Orgrimmar."},[8943]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto de Brumedo e um par de Guarda-braços de Brumedo para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8944]={d="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Leve um Cinto do Valor e um par de Manoplas do Valor para Mokvar, em Orgrimmar."},[8945]={d="I'll provide you the information you ask for, $N.  But more pressing matters are at hand.$B$BMy beloved wife has been taken prisoner by Rivendare's undead scum.$B$BI strongly objected to her joining the Argent Dawn's foolish crusade, yet that's not of importance anymore.  You must finish what I attempted to do, you must rescue Ysida from the clutches of the Baron!",o="Entre em Stratholme e resgate Ysida Harmon do Barão Rivendare."},[8946]={d="It is the cruelest of fates that my beloved has perished while trying to rescue me.  Yet, you claim to possess the ability to converse with him.$B$BBring him this locket as proof that I am well.  He must not linger in this world; my heart would not be able to bear it.$B$BFarewell, $N.  I shall be in your debt always.",o="Leve o Medalhão de Ysida para Anthion Harmon nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais."},[8947]={d="We didn't realize the importance of Valthalak's medallion, so it was divided along with the rest of the spoils.  The first piece was taken by a dwarf named Theldren.  I tried to retrieve it from him and he beat me within an inch of my life.  You shall have to take the fragment by force.$B$BLast I heard of him, he'd become a gladiator for the Dark Iron dwarves.  Getting him to fight you is going to present a bit of a challenge, though.$B$BGather the following materials for me.  You're going to need them.",o="Leve 3 Barras de Ferro Negro, 20 Couros Encantados, 3 Lunatramas e 4 Pelegos Rústicos Curados para Anthion Harmon nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais."},[8948]={d="Theldren is not one to willingly participate in a fair fight.  I've shaped this banner to display his family colors.$B$BWith some additional sorcery, this banner shall provoke him in a way he won't be able to resist.$B$BAn old acquaintance of mine named Falrin knows the exact procedure required.  He has a particular way of... aggravating people.  You shall find him at the library in Dire Maul.",o="Leve o Estandarte Incompleto da Provocação para Falrin Arboril na biblioteca do Gládio Cruel."},[8949]={d="Yes, it is true that I am familiar with this enchantment you require, $c.  Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend.$B$BI hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors.  And not only them, I hate the followers of Omokk just as much as I hate those that follow King Gordok.$B$BI want you to kill them.  Kill lots of them!  Bring me the beads they carry around their neck as proof of your work.  Do this and we shall talk about your request.",o="Colete 25 Colares de Guerra dos Ogros dos Ogros no Gládio Cruel ou no Pico da Rocha Negra e fale novamente com Falrin Arboril no Ateneu do Gládio Cruel."},[8950]={d="I can place the enchantment you require on the banner quite easily, $N.  Unfortunately I don't have the materials I need as it is very rarely that someone asks for this sort of charm.$B$BI will require the essence of one of the Eldreth ghosts that haunt these halls, a handful of Scholomance dark runes and some large brilliant shards.  Bring me these reagents and I shall perform this task for you.",o="Leve os seguintes materiais para Falrin Arboril no Gládio Cruel: 1 Essência de Espírito Zombeteiro, 4 Runas Negras e 8 Estilhaços Brilhantes Grandes."},[8951]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana, em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Botas do Coração Selvagem, Kilt do Coração Selvagem e Dragonas do Coração Selvagem."},[8952]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana, em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Botas do Espreitador de Feras, Calças do Espreitador de Feras e Dragonas do Espreitador de Feras."},[8953]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana em Altaforja, levando um par de Botas do Magíster, um par de Perneiras do Magíster e Dragonas do Magíster."},[8954]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana, em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Botas da Forja de Luz, Coxotes da Forja de Luz e Espaldares da Forja de Luz."},[8955]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana, em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Sandálias do Devoto, Saia do Devoto e Dragonas do Devoto."},[8956]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana em Altaforja com um conjunto de Botas da Arte Sombria, Calças da Arte Sombria e Espaldares da Arte Sombria."},[8957]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar, em Orgrimmar, com um conjunto de Botas dos Elementos, Kilt dos Elementos e Brafoneiras dos Elementos."},[8958]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Sandálias de Brumedo, Perneiras de Brumedo e Dragonas de Brumedo."},[8959]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Deliana em Altaforja, com um conjunto de Botas do Valor, Coxotes do Valor e Espaldares do Valor."},[8960]={d="So we need to recover the rest of the medallion?  Finding Bodley's going to be a bit of a headache.  He went back to Blackrock Mountain to attempt to re-enter Blackrock Spire and never came back.$B$BI'd suggest taking the goblin's ghost revealing device with you, as I fear the worst might have happened.",o="Vá até a Montanha Rocha Negra e use o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas para encontrar Bodley próximo ao Pico da Rocha Negra."},[8961]={d="In order to summon Lord Valthalak we're first going to need to gather the other two-thirds of the amulet. To do that we need to get a brazier and some special coals to burn in it.$B$BThere are three nobles of fire, Lord Incedius in Blackrock Depths, Pyroguard Emberseer in Blackrock Spire and The Duke of Cynders in Silithus, with what we need. Collect from each a piece of their remains, and then return to me with a Hallowed Brazier, which can be purchased from the Argent Dawn if you are honored by them.",o="Colete a Incendicita de Incendius, a Brasa do Mirabrasa e a Cinza das Cinzas, além de um Braseiro Santificado, e fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8962]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",o="Obtenha Restos Mortais Druídicos e os leve para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8963]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",o="Obtenha uma Relíquia do Vilarejo Brisastral e leve-a para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8964]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.$B$BThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",o="Obtenha uma Espada Brilhante do Fanatismo e leve-a para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8965]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",o="Obtenha Cinzas de Alma Banida e leve-as para Bodley, dentro da Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8966]={d="My friend, Mor Grayhoof, was the first to fall victim to possession of a piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, and the corrupting spirit fragment that it contains. After stealing Valthalak's spellbook and amulet, we fled for our lives from the upper portion of Blackrock Spire. Along the way, Mor fell into the lower portion of the spire.$B$BLater, we discovered that he survived the fall, only to be captured and tortured by War Master Voone. A few spectral assassins snuck in and slew him right in front of Voone.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Mor Casco Gris e então mate-o. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com a Parte Esquerda do Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8967]={d="It became known to us in later days, as we were doing what we could ourselves to survive, that Isalien, a night elf priestess of our company, had gone to the night elvic ancestral city, now known as Dire Maul. From what we gathered, she went there both for personal reasons and also to unlock the secrets of the piece of the amulet that she had in her possession.$B$BShe didn't quite make it, though. Word got back to us that she was ambushed at the Shrine of Eldretharr by Alzzin the Wildshaper and his forces.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Isalien e então mate-o. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com a Parte Esquerda do Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak restaurado e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8968]={d="The siblings, Jarien and Sothos, decided to join the Scarlet Crusade upon the disbanding of our mercenary company. They took the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet with them. Good riddance, I say, but we need that piece back.$B$BFrom what we could gather, they were actually slain by Grand Crusader Dathrohan himself for failing the initiation rites inside his chamber in the Scarlet Bastion.$B$BIn any case, we... meaning you, are still going to need to retrieve that piece of the amulet.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar os espíritos de Jil e Soeiro e então mate os dois. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com a Parte Esquerda do Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8969]={d="Now we have what we need, so it's time to discuss who it is that you'll be summoning.$B$BKormok was ok for an ogre, right up until he turned to necromancy. After that, things got creepy for just about everyone in the outfit. It was no surprise then when he took his piece of the amulet and returned to his new home, Scholomance.$B$BBut even there, or perhaps especially there, he was not safe from the spectral assassins. They slew him right in front of his master, Ras Frostwhisper.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Kormok e então mate-o. Fale novamente com Bodley, na Montanha Rocha Negra, com a Parte Esquerda do Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8970]={d="As I was saying, $c, in my living years I flirted with becoming a diviner. But, there really wasn't as much profit in it as you might imagine, mostly because it's dangerous and the reagents are rare and expensive. However, I do know enough to be able to pinpoint the final piece of the amulet, and the spirit of my former comrade along with it.$B$BThis is where you come in, $N. I need you to go to Alcaz Island off the coast of Dustwallow Marsh and collect Bloodkelp from the Strashaz naga that live there.",o="Colete 20 Algassangues das nagas Strashaz e fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8977]={d="It's been great working with you, $N.  Here is the finished product.$B$BI hope it helps you in your current endeavors.  And hey, if you don't mind, help spread the word.  I wouldn't mind having more customers!",o="Leve o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas para Deliana, em Altaforja."},[8978]={d="It's been great working with you, $N.  Here is the finished product.$B$BI hope it helps you in your current endeavors.  And hey, if you don't mind, help spread the word.  I wouldn't mind having more customers!",o="Reporte-se a Mokvar, em Orgrimmar, com o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas."},[8979]={d="I believe I know the cause of this recent behavior. Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind, over the stink of the canals? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion?$b$bOur thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.$b$bThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to my friend, Apothecary Zinge. The Royal Apothecary Society will find the truth.$b$b I will reimburse you for their purchase when you return.",o="Leve um Vidro de Colônia e um Frasco de Perfume para a Boticária Zilda no Boticarium da Cidade Baixa."},[8980]={d="This is unexpected. It looks like Fenstad might be on to something after all. I found traces of substances used in mind control potions.$b$bIt isn't unheard of for perfumes to have some of this, but a few of the ingredients I detected... This is serious alchemy, along the abilities of a member of the Royal Apothecary Society.",o="Fale com Félix Amado em frente ao banco da Cidade Baixa."},[8982]={d="We must find who the supplier is. I noticed Apothecary Katrina with a bottle of the perfume tucked in her pack. She told me that she purchased it from Norman, the innkeeper.",o="Fale com o Estalajadeiro Ronan na Cidade Baixa."},[8983]={d="Something's wrong with my product? Well, I've never seen so many people wanting something so badly.$b$bI bought my supply from a merchant named Mara Rennick. She's new in town.$b$bShe mentioned she had some goods she had to deliver to the tailor in the Mage Quarter.",o="Fale com Mara Reinoso na loja de alfaiataria no Distrito dos Magos da Cidade Baixa."},[8984]={d="Look, the actions of a rogue apothecary are not my concern. If he's undermining our efforts, then let me be the first to point you in the right direction$b$bIf he's innocent, then he's got nothing to hide, right?$b$bI purchased the goods from Apothecary Staffron Lerent. He's working in a secluded area past Ravenholdt Manor in the hills over Hillsbrad. To be honest with you, I thought he was a little odd.",o="Encontre o Boticário Adalberto Lorran no Contraforte de Eira dos Montes, para além da Mansão de Corvoforte."},[8985]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",o="Obtenha uma Relíquia do Vilarejo Brisastral e leve-a para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8986]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",o="Obtenha Restos Mortais Druídicos e os leve para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8987]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.$B$BThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",o="Obtenha uma Espada Brilhante do Fanatismo e leve-a para Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8988]={d="$C, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.$B$BAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",o="Obtenha Cinzas de Alma Banida e leve-as para Bodley, dentro da Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8989]={d="My friend, Mor Grayhoof, was the first to fall victim to possession of a piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, and the corrupting spirit fragment that it contains. After stealing Valthalak's spellbook and amulet, we fled for our lives from the upper portion of Blackrock Spire. Along the way, Mor fell into the lower portion of the spire.$B$BLater, we discovered that he survived the fall, only to be captured and tortured by War Master Voone. A few spectral assassins snuck in and slew him right in front of Voone.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Mor Casco Gris e então mate-o. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak restaurado e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8990]={d="It became known to us in later days, as we were doing what we could ourselves to survive, that Isalien, a night elf priestess of our company, had gone to the night elvic ancestral city, now known as Dire Maul. From what we gathered, she went there both for personal reasons and also to unlock the secrets of the piece of the amulet that she had in her possession.$B$BShe didn't quite make it, though. Word got back to us that she was ambushed at the Shrine of Eldretharr by Alzzin the Wildshaper and his forces.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Isalien e então mate-a Fale novamente com Bodley dentro da Montanha Rocha Negra. Leve o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak recombinado e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8991]={d="The siblings, Jarien and Sothos, decided to join the Scarlet Crusade upon the disbanding of our mercenary company. They took the Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet with them. Good riddance, I say, but we need that piece back.$B$BFrom what we could gather, they were actually slain by Grand Crusader Dathrohan himself for failing the initiation rites inside his chamber in the Scarlet Bastion.$B$BIn any case, we... meaning you, are still going to need to retrieve that piece of the amulet.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar os espíritos de Jil e Soeiro e então mate os dois. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak restaurado e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8992]={d="Now we have what we need, so it's time to discuss who it is that you'll be summoning next.$B$BKormok was ok for an ogre, right up until he turned to necromancy. After that, things got creepy for just about everyone in the outfit. It was no surprise then when he took his piece of the amulet and returned to his new home, Scholomance.$B$BBut even there, or perhaps especially there, he was not safe from the spectral assassins. They slew him right in front of his master, Ras Frostwhisper.",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o espírito de Kormok e então mate-o. Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra, com o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak restaurado e o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8994]={d="We're nearly there, $c. All that is left is to retrieve a few more components so that I can attune the brazier and enable it to beckon forth Lord Valthalak.$B$BTo begin I must ask you to journey forth into Blackrock Spire and slay the orcs therein. They wear bracers that contain trace metals that I will need, so I'll need more than a few to extract the right amount out of them. Then, to complete the imbuing process, you'll need to bring me a Flask of Supreme Power.$B$BGood luck, $N!",o="Colete 40 Braceletes de Rocha Negra e consiga um Frasco de Poder Supremo. Leve tudo para Bodley, dentro da Montanha Rocha Negra."},[8995]={d="All is now ready, $N.$B$BWhen alive, Lord Valthalak used to inhabit what is now The Beast's chamber. Go there and use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Lord Valthalak. It will reincorporate him, so he'll have to be killed again. I'd take care of The Beast first, and be sure take enough friends along to survive the upper portion of Blackrock Spire.$B$BOnce you've dispatched Valthalak, use the amulet on his corpse. With his spirit reunified, he'll likely want his amulet back, as well.$B$BGood luck!",o="Use o Braseiro de Sinalização para evocar o Lorde Valthalak. Acabe com ele e use o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak no cadáver. Em seguida, devolva o Amuleto do Lorde Valthalak ao Espírito de Lorde Valthalak."},[8996]={d="I will ignore your impertinence this time, $c, because you have done a noble thing today; returning the rest of my stolen spirit to me. Despite your obviously weak nature, $r, you have shown courage where those that stole from me did not, and probably never could!$B$BReturn to them, before I change my mind and slay you where you stand. Go back and tell them that they are safe... for now.",o="Fale novamente com Bodley na Montanha Rocha Negra e dê a ele o Braseiro de Sinalização."},[8997]={d="I suppose that this is goodbye then, my friend. But, I'll always be here if you want to come back and talk with me from time to time. Probably while you're loitering around waiting for your buddies to join you for a raid on Blackrock Spire.$B$BGo, before I start to cry. Go back to Deliana in Ironforge and tell her what's happened.",o="Fale com Deliana na Sala do Trono em Altaforja."},[8998]={d="I suppose that this is goodbye then, my friend. But, I'll always be here if you want to come back and talk with me from time to time. Probably while you're loitering around waiting for your buddies to join you for a raid on Blackrock Spire.$B$BGo, before I start to cry. Go back to Mokvar in Orgrimmar and tell him what's happened.",o="Fale com Mokvar no Castelo Grommash, que fica no Vale da Sabedoria, em Orgrimmar."},[8999]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Dê a Deliana seu Capucho do Coração Selvagem e seu Colete do Coração Selvagem."},[9000]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Casquete do Espreitador de Feras e sua Túnica do Espreitador de Feras a Deliana."},[9001]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Coroa do Magíster e suas Vestes do Magíster a Deliana."},[9002]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Elmo da Forja de Luz e o Peitoral da Forja de Luz a Deliana."},[9003]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Coroa do Devoto e sua Veste do Devoto a Deliana."},[9004]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Capuz da Arte Sombria e sua Túnica da Arte Sombria a Deliana."},[9005]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Máscara de Brumedo e sua Veste de Brumedo a Deliana."},[9006]={d="That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Elmo do Valor e seu Peitoral do Valor a Deliana."},[9007]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Capucho do Coração Selvagem e seu Colete do Coração Selvagem a Mokvar."},[9008]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Casquete do Espreitador de Feras e sua Túnica do Espreitador de Feras a Mokvar."},[9009]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Coroa do Devoto e sua Veste do Devoto a Mokvar."},[9010]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Capuz da Arte Sombria e sua Túnica da Arte Sombria a Mokvar."},[9011]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Dê a Mokvar sua Coifa dos Elementos e seu Colete dos Elementos."},[9012]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Máscara de Brumedo e sua Veste de Brumedo a Mokvar."},[9013]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue seu Elmo do Valor e seu Peitoral do Valor a Mokvar."},[9014]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="Entregue sua Coroa do Magíster e suas Vestes do Magíster a Mokvar."},[9015]={d="Heed me well, $N.  For the banner to work in the desired way, you will need to step into the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths.  Allow yourself to be sentenced by High Justice Grimstone and place the banner firmly on the ground in a sign of defiance.$B$BYour victim will not be able to restrain himself and shall enter the fray filled with a desire to fight you.  Once you obtain that which you seek, go back to Anthion.",o="Viaje até o Círculo da Lei no Abismo Rocha Negra e coloque o Estandarte da Provocação no centro enquanto ouve a sentença do Supremo Juiz Durólito. Mate Theldren e seus gladiadores e fale novamente com Anthion Harmon nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais em posse da primeira parte do amuleto de Lorde Valthalak."},[9016]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar, em Orgrimmar, com um conjunto de Botas do Coração Selvagem, Kilt do Coração Selvagem e Dragonas do Coração Selvagem."},[9017]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar em Orgrimmar com um conjunto de Botas do Espreitador de Feras, Calças do Espreitador de Feras e Dragonas do Espreitador de Feras."},[9018]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar em Orgrimmar com um conjunto de Botas do Magíster, Perneiras do Magíster e Dragonas do Magíster."},[9019]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar, em Orgrimmar, com um conjunto de Sandálias do Devoto, Saia do Devoto e Dragonas do Devoto."},[9020]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar em Orgrimmar com um conjunto de Botas da Arte Sombria, Calças da Arte Sombria e Espaldares da Arte Sombria."},[9021]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar em Orgrimmar com um conjunto de Sandálias de Brumedo, Perneiras de Brumedo e Dragonas de Brumedo."},[9022]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together.  Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Fale novamente com Mokvar em Orgrimmar com um conjunto de Botas do Valor, Coxotes do Valor e Espaldares do Valor."},[9023]={d="My brother and I run the poison operations out of the manor Ravenholdt.$B$BLord Ravenholdt tasked me to track down a new and extremely effective poison compound that can be crafted from the venom sacs of the inhabitants of Zul'Gurub and the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.$B$BThere are two particularly venomous beasts residing in those blasted ruins that possess what it is that we might be looking for, $c. Bring me a venom sac from the beasts Kurinnaxx and Venoxis and we would be eternally grateful.",o="Dirk Fortelenho no Forte Cenariano quer que você leve para ele uma Vesícula de Peçonha de Venoxis e uma Vesícula de Peçonha de Kurinnaxx."},[9024]={d="I've got it! Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion? Our guards wouldn't neglect their duties so easily.$b$bThat is, unless their thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.$b$bThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to Morgan Pestle, and tell him my suspicions. I will reimburse you for their purchase when you return.",o="Leve 1 Vidro de Colônia e 1 Frasco de Perfume para Morgado Pilão no Distrito Comercial de Ventobravo."},[9025]={d="Well, I'll be. It looks like Aristan might be on to something after all. I found traces of substances used in love potions and insidious mind-altering draughts.$b$bIt isn't unheard of for perfumes to have some of them, but a few of the ingredients I detected... Smells funny.",o="Fale novamente com Aristeu Motta em frente ao banco, no Distrito Comercial de em Ventobravo."},[9026]={d="We've got to find the source. I've seen a lot more people than usual - guards included - going in and out of The Gilded Rose. Talk to Allison. If she's selling them, she can tell you where they came from.",o="Fale com a Estalajadeira Cristine na estalagem Rosa Dourada, que fica no Distrito Comercial de Ventobravo."},[9027]={d="Something funny about the cologne? It's possible. I've never seen so many people after one product like this.$b$bLook, if there's something wrong with it, I want to know, too. I bought my supply from a merchant named Evert Sorisam. He's new in town.$b$bHe mentioned he had some goods he was going to deliver to The Finest Thread.",o="Fale com Everton Soniram no Empório das Linhas, que fica perto dos canais de Ventobravo."},[9028]={d="What? Treason? No, no. I assure you, my intentions are completely harmless.$b$bIs it so wrong to help those who wish to ease the painful ritual of courtship? Come, that is no crime.$b$bAnd to prove that I mean no harm, I will even tell you my source.$b$bThey were shipped to me by a Staffron Lerent, an apothecary of some sort. I never spoke with him.$b$bOur goblin middle man said that he worked in the foothills over Hillsbrad past that mysterious Ravenholdt Manor. I wish you luck in finding him.",o="Encontre o Boticário Adalberto Lorran no Contraforte de Eira dos Montes, atrás da Mansão de Corvoforte."},[9030]={d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck, and you shall need it!",o="Speak to Deliana in Ironforge."},[9032]={d="The medallion contained Valthalak's soul?  It's no surprise it was guarded by such a powerful curse.$B$BLocating Bodley presents a bit of a problem.  Last time I heard of him, he was preparing to venture back into Blackrock Spire.  He was never heard of again.$B$BSeek him out in Blackrock Mountain, though I'm afraid to say he's probably dead by now.  I suggest taking the goblin's device with you, friend.",o="Vá até a Montanha Rocha Negra e use o Revelador Extradimensional de Fantasmas para encontrar Bodley próximo ao Pico da Rocha Negra."},[9033]={d="Five years since the last war...$B$BTens of thousands of lives were lost and for what? The threat was never fully extinguished.$B$BAnd so the Lich King stirs once more... His yes-man, Kel'Thuzad, amassing for another attack upon our lands.$B$BWe will not allow it! Prove your dedication. Prove that you are willing to risk life and limb to stop this madness and the combined might of the Dawn and the Crusade will be at your beck and call.$B$BEnter Naxxramas and destroy the Scourge within...",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, quer que você mate 5 Monstruosidades Vivas, 5 Gárgulas Litopele, 8 Capitães Cavaleiros da Morte e 3 Espreitadoras Peçonhentas."},[9034]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Peitoral Couraçado caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 Peitoral Profanado, 25 Restos de Placas, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 2 Cristais do Nexus."},[9036]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Coxotes Couraçados caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 par de Coxotes Profanados, 20 Restos de Placas, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9037]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Capacete Couraçado caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 Capacete Profanado, 15 Restos de Placas, 5 Barras de Arcanita e 1 Cristal do Nexus."},[9038]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Brafoneiras Couraçadas caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 par de Brafoneiras Profanadas, 12 Restos de Placas, 2 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9039]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Escarpes Couraçados caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 par de Escarpes Profanados, 12 Restos de Placas, 2 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9040]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Manoplas Couraçadas caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 Manopla Profanada, 8 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 5 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9041]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você uma Cinta Couraçada caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 Cinta Profanada, 8 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 5 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9042]={d="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Braçadeiras Couraçadas caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 Braçadeira Profanada, 6 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 1 Cristal do Nexus."},[9043]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você uma Túnica da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Túnica Profanada, 25 Restos de Placas, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9044]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um par de Guarda-pernas da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Guarda-pernas Profanado, 20 Restos de Placas, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 2 Cristais do Nexus."},[9045]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Bacinete da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Bacinete Profanado, 15 Restos de Placas, 5 Barras de Arcanita e 2 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9046]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um par de Espaldares da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Espaldar Profanado, 12 Restos de Placas, 2 Barras de Arcanita e 2 Cristais do Nexus."},[9047]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Botas da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Bota Profanada, 12 Restos de Placas, 2 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9048]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="O Comandante Eligor Alvorada, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Protetores de Mão da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 Protetor de Mão Profanado, 8 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 5 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9049]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="Comandante Eligor Alvorada, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Cinturão da Redenção se você levar para ele: 1 Cinturão Profanado, 8 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 3 Cristais do Nexus."},[9050]={d="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="Comandante Eligor Alvorada, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Munhequeiras da Redenção caso você leve para ele o seguinte: 1 par de Munhequeiras Profanadas, 6 Restos de Placas, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 2 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9051]={d="The toxin you helped me create is for a special purpose.  The great devilsaurs of the crater make it dangerous to hunt and difficult for me to survive.  Even if I possessed the necessary strength, killing a devilsaur simply allows another to move into its territory.$b$bTake this poisoned barb and stab it deep into a living devilsaur.  The toxin should pacify the creature, though I do not know how quickly...",o="Espete um Demossauro com uma Farpa para Demossauro. Fale novamente com Torwa Mateiro na Cratera Un'goro depois que tiver terminado a tarefa."},[9052]={d="I would ask you to help me create a toxin of sorts, to pacify a great creature living here in the crater.  It is not deadly, and only the keen eyes of a $c can hope to collect the ingredients.$b$bYou can find the bloodcap mushrooms growing within the bloodpetal sprouts all across the crater.  Gorishi stings are from the giant flying wasps inside and around the Slithering Scar, located in the southern part of the crater.",o="Colete 8 Cogumelos Vermelhos e 8 Ferrões de Gorishi e fale novamente com Torwa Mateiro na Cratera Un'Goro."},[9053]={d="It is as I feared -- the toxin is simply too weak for such a powerful creature.$b$bIf we are to create a toxin of high enough potency, you must venture to the bottom of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, unlock the secrets of the altar and recover a putrid vine from the guardian there.  The temple is dangerous, and it would behoove you to bring friends.$b$bReturn to me when this is done.",o="Consiga uma Trepadeira Pútrida do guardião no fundo do Templo Submerso e fale novamente com Torwa Mateiro."},[9054]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Túnica Criptalante se você levar para ele: 1 Túnica Profanada, 25 Restos de Cota de Malha, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9055]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Guarda-pernas Criptalantes se você levar para ele: 1 Guarda-pernas Profanado, 20 Restos de Cota de Malha, 3 Barras de Arcanita e 5 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9056]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Bacinete Criptalante se você levar para ele: 1 Bacinete Profanado, 15 Restos de Cota de Malha, 4 Barras de Arcanita e 2 Cristais do Nexus."},[9057]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, da Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Espaldares Criptalantes se você levar para ele: 1 Espaldar Profanado, 12 Restos de Cota de Malha, 2 Barras de Arcanita e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9058]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um par de Botas Criptalantes se você levar para ele: 1 par de Botas Profanadas, 12 Restos de Cota de Malha, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 3 Cristais do Nexus."},[9059]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Protetores de Mão Criptalantes se você levar para ele: 1 Protetores de Mão Profanados, 8 Restos de Cota de Malha, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 5 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9060]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Cinturão Criptalante se você levar para ele: 1 Cinturão Profanado, 8 Restos de Cota de Malha, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 3 Cristais do Nexus."},[9061]={d="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="O Guarda-caça Leopold, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Munhequeiras Criptalantes caso você leve para ele os seguintes itens: 1 conjunto de Munhequeiras Profanadas, 6 Restos de Cota de Malha, 1 Barra de Arcanita e 2 Pelegos Rústicos Curados."},[9063]={d="A hunter by the name of Torwa Pathfinder has requested the help of a druid.  He said only we would possess the necessary skills and respect for nature to help him.$b$bThere is a road that connects the Un'Goro Crater and the desert of Tanaris.  As that road enters the crater, you will find Torwa close by.",o="Fale com Torwa Mateiro na Cratera Un'Goro."},[9065]={d="$Tpunk;!  Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em.",o="Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em."},[9068]={d="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?$B$BThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.$B$BBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.$B$BSearch Naxxramas.",o="Rimblat Quebraterra, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você uma Tú